    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d157">

                <pb facs="0336" n="236" sameAs="frus:frus1884/pg236"/>

                <head>No. 157.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. West to Mr.
                    Frelinghuysen.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1884-01-02"><hi rendition="#italic">January</hi> 2, 1884.</date>
                        (Received January 4.)</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: With reference to your note of the 28th of
                    September last, I have the honor to inclose herewith copy of an approved report
                    of a committee of the privy council of Canada, setting forth the views of the
                    Government on the subject of the landing of a proposed cable in Washington
                    Territory.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>L. S. SACKVILLE–WEST.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d157-a1.xml" xpointer="d157-a1"/>
            </div>
